<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>本草经下经 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:24:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>二七四、草蒿</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/274-caohao/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:24:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/274-caohao/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;和青蒿类似，主要治疗皮肤病、疥疮、肝胆虚热。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;一名青蒿。一名方溃。味苦，寒，无毒。治疥瘙痂痒，恶疮，杀虱，留热在骨节间，明目。生川泽。一名青蒿，一名方溃。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;可以做茶饮。青蒿可以去肝胆火，平常可以泡茶喝，有点微苦。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二七三、莨菪子</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/273-langdangzi/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:23:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/273-langdangzi/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这个药是根入药，现在用的不多。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味苦，寒，有毒。治齿痛、出虫，肉痹拘急。使人健行、见鬼。多食令人狂走。久服轻身、走及奔马。强志，益力，通神。生海滨、川谷。一名横唐。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>二七二、桔梗</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/272-jiegeng/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:22:30 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/272-jiegeng/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;也是治疗跟肺有关的病，用在肺吐脓疡（化脓）的时候。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，微温有小毒。治胸胁痛如刀刺，腹满，肠鸣幽幽，惊恐悸气。生山谷。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;通过痰来确定用药。病人咳嗽吐痰，如果是焦黄的痰，那用生半夏、天南星；如果是白泡泡的脓痰，这种比较麻烦，肺癌病人多有这种痰，要用桔梗。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二七一、葶苈</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/271-tingli/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:21:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/271-tingli/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这是经方里会用到的药，治疗肺癌、气喘会用到。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，寒，无毒。治症瘕，积聚，结气，饮食寒热，破坚，逐邪，通利水道。生平泽及田野。一名大室，一名大适。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="产地"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【产地】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e4%ba%a7%e5%9c%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;产我国河南陕西河北一带，有甜苦二种，今俱以甜者入药，且多以荠子或折蓂子混充，苦者绝少。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;葶苈有两种。葶苈有苦的也有甜的，现在是以甜味的入药，药房多以荠子或者折蓂子来混充，苦味的很少，最早的葶苈子是苦味的。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二七〇、大黄</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/270-dahuang/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:20:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/270-dahuang/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;因为性彪悍，又名川将军，即川军，甘肃也产大黄，纹路较多，叫作锦纹大黄，我们常使用的是川军。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;像大黄、附子、天南星、芒硝这些药，药性比较峻，温病派都不用的，而这些是经方中非常重要的药。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六九、鸢尾</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/269-yuanwei/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:19:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/269-yuanwei/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这是个植物名，跟后面二百七十八讲的射干是一个药，后面再讲。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味苦，平，有毒。治蛊毒，邪气，鬼疰，诸毒。破症瘕，积聚，去水，下三虫。生山谷。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六八、虎掌</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/268-huzhang/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:18:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/268-huzhang/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;也叫天南星，攻痰的力量很强。不是老虎的掌哦~&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味苦，温，有大毒。治心痛，寒热，结气，积聚，伏梁，伤筋，瘘，拘缓，利水道。生山谷。又名虎掌，今名天南星。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;天南星、蛤蜊都能祛痰。蛤蜊祛痰是喉咙里的痰，比如甲状腺、腮腺肿大，咽炎、喉癌等，天南星负责去胸腔（肺）里的痰。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六七、半夏</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/267-banxia/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:17:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/267-banxia/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;半夏有生半夏和姜半夏两种&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，平，有毒。治伤寒，寒热，心下坚，下气，喉咽肿痛，头眩，胸胀，咳逆、肠鸣，止汗。生山谷。一名地文，一名水玉。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;为何半夏又叫作水玉？半夏又叫做水玉，因为它排水祛痰的效果特别好。拿一颗生半夏摩擦甲状腺肿大处，不一会你就听到里面有水声，所以叫水玉，生半夏就是这么强，祛痰止咳、打开喉咙都会用到生半夏。病人痰很多的时候，西医会打个洞抽痰，中医会用生半夏。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六六、天雄</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/266-tianxiong/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:16:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/266-tianxiong/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;附子、乌头、天雄都是同一株植物上来的，第三年采收的是附子，第四年采收的是乌头，第五年采收的根茎就是天雄，天雄顾名思义就是令人吃了变得雄壮，壮阳的药。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六五、乌头</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/265-wutou/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:15:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/265-wutou/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;上一味讲附子已经说过乌头和附子是同一植物的不同部位，如上图乌头是母根，附子是附生的，此外乌头毒性大大强于附子。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，温，有大毒。治中风，恶风洒洒，出汗，除寒湿痹，咳逆上气，破积聚，寒热。其汁煎之，名射罔。杀禽兽。生山谷。一名奚毒，一名即子，一名乌喙。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;什么情况用乌头？有患者得了风湿关节炎吃过量的止痛药之后会严重伤肾，然后去洗肾，其实乌头是治疗风湿关节炎最强的药。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六四、附子</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/264-fuzi/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/264-fuzi/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;是很重要的一味药，张仲景是最会用附子的人，经方里很多方子用到附子，是重点讲的一味药。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;现代人讲生附子不能用。现代人说张仲景是医圣，《伤寒论》是圣经，张仲景是最会用附子的人，结果现代人说生附子不能用，这太矛盾了。倪海厦老师说他是用附子用得很多的，因为遇到的多是重症，附子是比较凶的药，才能见效。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六三、青琅玕</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/263-qinglanggan/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:13:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/263-qinglanggan/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;一名石珠。味辛，平，无毒。治身痒，火疮，痈伤，白秃，疥瘙，死肌。生平泽。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六二、冬灰</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/262-donghui/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:12:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/262-donghui/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;一名藜灰。味辛，微温。治黑子，去疣息肉，疽蚀，疥瘙。生川泽。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六一、白垩</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/261-baie/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:11:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/261-baie/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;就是白土，过去画家用来做颜料的。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味苦，温，无毒。治女子寒热，症瘕，月闭，积聚，阴肿痛，漏下，无子。生山谷。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="产地"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【产地】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e4%ba%a7%e5%9c%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;产河南山西，今他省亦多有之，画家用之，亦名画粉。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="性味"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【性味】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%80%a7%e5%91%b3" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味苦，性温，无毒。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="主治"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【主治】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e4%b8%bb%e6%b2%bb" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;白垩主燥湿温臓，治吐血反胃泻痢，外用治风赤烂眼，疿疹搔痒。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;土类药能燥湿。土能治水，土类药能燥湿，所以用来治疗反胃泻痢、皮肤病等&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二六〇、卤咸</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/260-luxian/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:10:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/260-luxian/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;就是盐，有青盐，也有海盐。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味苦，寒，无毒。治大热，消渴，狂烦，除邪及吐下蛊毒，柔肌肤。一名寒石。生盐池。大盐，一名胡盐。寒，无毒。治肠胃结热，令人吐。生池泽。戎盐。主明目，目痛，益气，坚肌骨，去毒蛊。生北地。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;吃盐要适量。吃适量的盐可以排水（天然的盐，而非精致盐），但如果过量了咸能伤骨，也会让血液变浓稠，甚至导致肌肉萎缩。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二五九、代赭</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/259-daizhe/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:09:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/259-daizhe/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;就是代赭石，张仲景会用到这个药。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味苦，寒，无毒。治鬼疰，贼风，蛊毒，杀精物恶鬼，腹中毒，邪气，女子赤沃漏下。生山谷。一名须丸。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;为啥说能治疗【鬼疰，贼风，蛊毒，杀精物恶鬼】？因为过去吃坏肚子，上吐下泻的症状，人们就担心是中邪了。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二五八、粉钖</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/258-fenyang/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:08:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/258-fenyang/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;粉锡，这是外用的药，不内服，用在毒虫咬伤。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本绖原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本绖原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%96%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，寒，无毒。治伏尸，毒螫，杀三虫。锡镜鼻，平。治女子血闭，症瘕，伏肠，绝孕。生山谷。一名解锡。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="产地"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【产地】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e4%ba%a7%e5%9c%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;以醋蒸铅化合而成，日本产此甚多，我国亦有制出，色白，故亦曰白粉，以其为铅所化，故亦曰铅粉。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这是用醋蒸铅得到的，也叫铅粉。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二五七、铅丹</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/257-qiandan/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:07:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/257-qiandan/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;金属类的药比较沉，铅丹用于治疗癫痫。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;小编：打铁花的生铁落。这个可是治疗狂躁症、癫痫、精神病非常好的一味药。（柴胡加龙骨牡蛎汤，里边的铅丹，可以用生铁落代替，效果非常好，还没副作用）&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二五六、礜石</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/256-yushi/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:06:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/256-yushi/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;也叫青分石、固羊石，很毒，人吃了就中毒，蚕宝宝吃了反而不饿，就不想吃蚕叶了。这个药用的不多，各位知道就好。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，大热，有毒。治寒热，鼠瘘，蚀疮，死肌，风痹，腹中坚癖，邪气，除热。生山谷。一名青分石，一名立制石，一名固羊石。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>二五五、石灰</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/255-shihui/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:05:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/255-shihui/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;一般在山里找到青白色的石头，经过烘焙就可得到。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，温。治疽，疡，疥瘙，热气，恶疮，癞疾，死肌，堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子、息肉。生川谷。一名恶灰。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="产地"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【产地】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e4%ba%a7%e5%9c%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;近山处皆有之，其石青白色，作窑烧之，则成石灰。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="性味"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【性味】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%80%a7%e5%91%b3" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，性温，有毒&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;石灰温性药。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>